<p>
  <%= link_to "Sign in to Chorifico", sign_in_url(token: @token) %>.

  The link works once and expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, SignInToken::EXPIRES_IN) %>.
  It opens a page with a button on it; nothing is signed in until you press that button.
</p>

<p>
  If you did not ask to sign in, ignore this message and the link expires unused.
</p>
